        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Upon receipt of a \"Payroll Deduction Authorization\" from an Employee, in the form attached hereto as (Exhibit A of Appendix 3), Lucent Technologies Inc. will initiate deductions for amounts equal to Union Dues (and, if authorized, an Initiation Fee) from such Employee's salary or wages, sickness or disability payments, or other benefit payments or vacation payments.",
